{"id":1010704,"chapter_id":1010704,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"【辛迪加一个明亮的病床，没有特别舒适的话就用新城白天那个】","style":18,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"锈","content":"…………","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"睁开眼，窗明几净，再不是噩梦轮回中的污秽场面。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"他以为自己还没醒，或者又死了一回。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"可一回头，看见${PlayerName}就在床边，见人醒了，表情一转恼怒，狠狠瞪着他。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"锈这才想起来了睡前发生的事……原来是他把自己带了回来。","female_content":"锈这才想起来了睡前发生的事……原来是她把自己带了回来。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"锈","content":"……不愧是局长，这么快又把我抓了回来，说到做到，了不起。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704008,"trial_step":8},{"step":8,"options":["快吗？"],"style":6,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704009,"trial_step":9,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"快吗？","goto":10}]},{"step":9,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你睡了整整一周，我还以为你再醒不来了。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704010,"trial_step":10},{"step":10,"speaker":"锈","content":"您在生气吗？哦……我想起来了。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704011,"trial_step":11},{"step":11,"speaker":"锈","content":"抱歉，那会儿把您错认成别人，做了些失礼的事。我应该没伤到您吧？","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704012,"trial_step":12},{"step":12,"options":["没","凭你？"],"style":6,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704013,"trial_step":13,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"没","goto":14},{"text":"凭你？","goto":17}]},{"step":13,"content":"你瞪着他。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"毕竟现在缠100层绷带埋进病床演木乃伊的人不是我。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"content":"你瞪着他。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704017,"trial_step":17},{"step":16,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"放着不管能自己把自己玩死的“特工”，能被你伤一根手指算我输。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704018,"trial_step":18},{"step":17,"speaker":"锈","content":"哈哈……别担心，托狂厄的福，这副身体修复得很快，马上就能下床，您无需在意。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704019,"trial_step":19},{"step":18,"content":"去他的，你很在意。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704020,"trial_step":20},{"step":19,"options":["修复得快，所以找死似的乱来？"],"style":6,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704021,"trial_step":21,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"修复得快，所以找死似的乱来？","goto":22}]},{"step":20,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你那种战斗方式可不是一个严谨的特工会干的，想死吗？","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704022,"trial_step":22},{"step":21,"speaker":"锈","content":"……","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704023,"trial_step":23},{"step":22,"speaker":"锈","content":"……但死对我来说没什么大不了。过段时间，迟早会在黑环中复生。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704025,"trial_step":25},{"step":23,"speaker":"锈","content":"话说回来……我也告诉过您了，您惦记的那位严谨特工早在两年前就被杀害，现在的“锈”是另一副身体，另一个人，也许性格有点偏激，抱歉没能让您满意。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704026,"trial_step":26},{"step":24,"speaker":"锈","content":"或者下次等我死过再回来，挑一副更合您心意的模样？","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704027,"trial_step":27},{"step":25,"speaker":"锈","content":"您喜欢什么都可以，变成女性也没问题。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704028,"trial_step":28},{"step":26,"content":"【空场1秒】配一个啪呲碎玻璃的音效，表示局长理智快崩","style":18,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704029,"trial_step":29},{"step":27,"options":["……死对你来说是很简单的事吗？"],"style":6,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704030,"trial_step":30,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……死对你来说是很简单的事吗？","goto":31}]},{"step":28,"speaker":"锈","content":"毕竟不止一次，也试过几种死法，我早已习惯。下次让我完整体验一下被枷锁清除的感觉吧。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704031,"trial_step":31},{"step":29,"content":"他体腔内有些异样。不久前枷锁曾经穿透他的身体，那时他能清晰感受到尖刺穿过胸腔，穿过肋骨，擦过心脏……十分特别的感觉。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704032,"trial_step":32},{"step":30,"content":"对其他禁闭者无害的枷锁，对他这样的身体杀伤力可不低。疼痛竟还让他有些恍惚的上瘾。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704033,"trial_step":33},{"step":31,"speaker":"锈","content":"真是很特别的力量，只要您愿意，应该就能轻松把我撕碎。理论上还能阻止意识回归黑环，毕竟枷锁的胃口比黑环大……","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704034,"trial_step":34},{"step":32,"speaker":"锈","content":"……呵呵，好像也算是种解脱，是个不错的结果……","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704035,"trial_step":35},{"step":33,"content":"他的话换来一阵僵硬的沉默，好一会儿，你才开口。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704036,"trial_step":36},{"step":34,"options":["……我说过，别再说这种话了"],"style":6,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704037,"trial_step":37,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……我说过，别再说这种话了","goto":38}]},{"step":35,"speaker":"锈","content":"……","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704038,"trial_step":38},{"step":36,"content":"${PlayerName}在生气，锈清晰感受到这点。眼下这具身体没有死去，所以他能轻松回想起不久前的的记忆。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704039,"trial_step":39},{"step":37,"content":"【进入回忆：阶段3结尾的战场","style":18,"background":2069109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704040,"trial_step":40},{"step":38,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"说什么蠢话！你不是有必须要做的事吗？不是宁愿丢掉过去也要埋头往前走吗？不是很固执吗？","style":1,"background":2069109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704041,"trial_step":41},{"step":39,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"那还死什么死！睁眼！死死活活那么多次都扛下来了，这次也一样，再怎么难受也活下去，靠恨也必须活下去！你还欠着一屁股债呢，起来！","style":1,"background":2069109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704042,"trial_step":42},{"step":40,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"别想用我的手给你解脱，我不会杀你的，把我拉下水，那我只有一句话——","style":1,"background":2069109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704043,"trial_step":43},{"step":41,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"<color=#fb9259><size=52><b><i>活下去！不准死！！</color></size></i></b>","style":1,"background":2069109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704044,"trial_step":44},{"step":42,"content":"【退出回忆】","style":18,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704045,"trial_step":45},{"step":43,"content":"逆着夕阳，锈看不清你的脸，但被埋进体内的枷锁清晰传递出你的愤怒。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704046,"trial_step":46},{"step":44,"content":"他终于意识到自己的失言。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704047,"trial_step":47},{"step":45,"speaker":"锈","content":"……抱歉，我开玩笑的。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704048,"trial_step":48},{"step":46,"speaker":"锈","content":"以后不会再提了。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704049,"trial_step":49},{"step":47,"content":"是因为缠着绷带躺在病床实实在在地虚弱不堪吗？他平时那股让人火大的“游刃有余特工劲儿”竟然消失了，竟真给人一种他在真诚反省的幻觉。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704050,"trial_step":50},{"step":48,"content":"……也许不是幻觉，他看着前方，眼神却没聚焦到任何现实的东西。这份不加掩饰的失焦才像是他的底色。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704051,"trial_step":51},{"step":49,"speaker":"锈","content":"……我对您做了失礼的事。我一直以为自己目标坚定，现在看来……会暗戳戳地寻死，就说明我潜意识里还有窝囊的一面。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704052,"trial_step":52},{"step":50,"speaker":"锈","content":"但放心吧，就算不爱惜生命，我也没那么容易接受死亡。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704053,"trial_step":53},{"step":51,"speaker":"锈","content":"毕竟死后，意识总要回到令人作呕的黑环，一不留神就会被溶解吸收，成为那东西的口粮……想到这儿，我就难以忍受，拼尽全力也要活着出来，爬也要爬出黑环。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704054,"trial_step":54},{"step":52,"speaker":"锈","content":"可能这才是我顽强活到今天的源动力吧。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704055,"trial_step":55},{"step":53,"content":"他没看你，看着自己绷带下的手。还是死灰般的身体，连伤口都不带血色。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704056,"trial_step":56},{"step":54,"speaker":"锈","content":"……我早就失去了生命的实感，能苟活到现在，全因为黑环的<color=#fb9259>诅咒</color>，那么……我活下去的目的也只剩一个。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704057,"trial_step":57},{"step":55,"speaker":"锈","content":"——不惜一切驱逐黑环，驱逐那些散播黑环的狂徒。为此，我乐意跟你们合作，也会努力协助你，保护你，因为你很重要。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704058,"trial_step":58},{"step":56,"speaker":"锈","content":"但我没办法向你保证、也无法假装爱惜生命。我选定的路无法避免危险，我随时可能死亡，被困进黑环，要挣扎很久才能回来。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704059,"trial_step":59},{"step":57,"speaker":"锈","content":"……等回来时，也许普通人的一辈子也就过去了。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704060,"trial_step":60},{"step":58,"content":"他又停了很久，好一会儿，才转过头，看向你。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704061,"trial_step":61},{"step":59,"speaker":"锈","content":"局长，对我使用枷锁吧。你的力量好像能窥探连我也看不清的记忆，那就趁现在，能看多少是多少。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704062,"trial_step":62},{"step":60,"speaker":"锈","content":"我的“一生”很不可靠，如果能给你留下点什么，也算值得高兴的事。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704063,"trial_step":63},{"step":61,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……别说这种话，别一副自己怎么死都无所谓的样子。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704064,"trial_step":64},{"step":62,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你活着不只为什么“使命”，这条命也不只对你一个人……","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704065,"trial_step":65},{"step":63,"speaker":"锈","content":"没办法，改不了的。有些人就是这么顽固。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704066,"trial_step":66},{"step":64,"speaker":"锈","content":"毕竟他们只在乎这些，也只有这点坚持了。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704067,"trial_step":67},{"step":65,"content":"他笑着打断了你，伸手，示意你使用枷锁。这样确实能避免一切监视，也能规避他的谎言、省去你的猜忌，而且……","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704068,"trial_step":68},{"step":66,"content":"看样子他能找到被他逃避或遗忘的黑暗记忆，也相信你能将他的一切用到正途。但……","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704069,"trial_step":69},{"step":67,"options":["没必要"],"style":6,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704070,"trial_step":70,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"没必要","goto":71}]},{"step":68,"speaker":"锈","content":"为什么？这明明是你们最需要的。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704071,"trial_step":71},{"step":69,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我需要的自己会找，而且，我找人测试过，做过实验了。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704072,"trial_step":72},{"step":70,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"枷锁没有窥视他人灵魂的能力，从来不是我想看就给我看什么。那次意外，我会看见那些记忆，其实都是受你的影响。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704073,"trial_step":73},{"step":71,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你们这样跟黑环有牵扯的人，似乎会把自己心里的想法通过狂厄反向灌输给枷锁，灌输到我身上。明白这点后，我就感到很好奇了……","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704074,"trial_step":74},{"step":72,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"为什么当时你那强烈到能反噬我的意识，并不是你老挂在嘴边的责任、使命、道路、黑环地底，而是你口口声声说要割舍告别的过往？","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704075,"trial_step":75},{"step":73,"speaker":"锈","content":"………………","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704076,"trial_step":76},{"step":74,"content":"他的表情让你忍不住笑了。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704077,"trial_step":77},{"step":75,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"特工先生自己都没意识到吗？哈哈，明明那么挂念旧友，就别总说什么要放下了。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704078,"trial_step":78},{"step":76,"speaker":"锈","content":"……又来了，您认定一件事，偶尔会这样不讲道理。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704079,"trial_step":79},{"step":77,"options":["不需要讲道理"],"style":6,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704080,"trial_step":80,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"不需要讲道理","goto":81}]},{"step":78,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"当作我的希望也行。很多人跟我一样，希望你和他们一样珍视那些牵绊。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704081,"trial_step":81},{"step":79,"content":"你将一封撕掉的遗书放到他面前，是棘拒收的。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704082,"trial_step":82},{"step":80,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我什么都没告诉他，第九机关也严守保密规则。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704083,"trial_step":83},{"step":81,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"但经过上次锈河的事，我想那位特工多少已经猜到了。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704084,"trial_step":84},{"step":82,"content":"【进入回忆】","style":18,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704085,"trial_step":85},{"step":83,"speaker":"棘","content":"……我知道他不是敌人，我……","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704086,"trial_step":86},{"step":84,"speaker":"棘","content":"……","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704087,"trial_step":87},{"step":85,"content":"【退出回忆】","style":18,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704088,"trial_step":88},{"step":86,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"棘托我回话，他说：一个活人不该写遗书，有什么话就该当面讲。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704089,"trial_step":89},{"step":87,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"还有店长，桑吉……你委托我的每一件事，现在我都一一回绝，欠了东西的人不是我，大家想见的人也不是我，既然还活着，就自己去做吧。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704090,"trial_step":90},{"step":88,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"想说的话亲自说给他们听。哪怕换了身体也好，不出声不露面也罢，说不定在乎这些的人并不多。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704091,"trial_step":91},{"step":89,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"说不定……有更多人其实不在乎你来自哪儿、不在乎你变成什么样，他们只想知道你现在怎么样了。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704092,"trial_step":92},{"step":90,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"不管你换多少张脸，声音，或身体、记忆。这几年间，你拼尽全力舍弃生死去做的事早已留下痕迹，改变了很多人，也被很多人牵挂着。","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704093,"trial_step":93},{"step":91,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我这么说，你还觉得自己活着没有实感，死是一件能轻松谈论的事吗？","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704094,"trial_step":94},{"step":92,"speaker":"锈","content":"……这样。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704095,"trial_step":95},{"step":93,"content":"他垂下头，时间一点一滴流逝，他像想了很久，才轻轻答道。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704096,"trial_step":96},{"step":94,"speaker":"锈","content":"……我现在答不上来，也许……下次聊？","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704097,"trial_step":97},{"step":95,"options":["下次？"],"style":6,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704098,"trial_step":98,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"下次？","goto":99}]},{"step":96,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"你每次说完“下次聊”都会把我支开，然后找空逃走，这次也是吗？","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704099,"trial_step":99},{"step":97,"content":"他有些尴尬地笑笑。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704100,"trial_step":100},{"step":98,"speaker":"锈","content":"呵呵，不会的，我是真的希望好好想想，毕竟以前从没这么想过。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704101,"trial_step":101},{"step":99,"content":"他抬起头看向屋顶，很努力地想，想给一个真诚的答案。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704102,"trial_step":102},{"step":100,"content":"可是……温暖的阳光，床边的花，柔软的被褥，安静的吊瓶点滴声，消毒水的味道，甚至久违的骨骼痛感，来自这边世界的信息突然涨潮淹没了他。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704103,"trial_step":103},{"step":101,"content":"紧绷了不知多少辈子的“间谍”再也绷不住疲惫的神经，他竟然放松下来，明明还想跟${PlayerName}多说些话，可涌起的令人安心的困意已经占据了他的一切。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704104,"trial_step":104},{"step":102,"speaker":"锈","content":"……让我想一想吧，局长。这个问题也许对我很重要。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704105,"trial_step":105},{"step":103,"content":"门外，医护已经向你招手。黑石英冒了个头，它能来，要么盯上了锈，要么给你带大活，算算时间，大概是费沙那边又有事了吧。总之，探病时间结束了。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704106,"trial_step":106},{"step":104,"options":["……我明白了。"],"style":6,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704107,"trial_step":107,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"……我明白了。","goto":108}]},{"step":105,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"这里的医护会好好照顾你，早点好，还有很多人等你的交代。也别想逃走，MBCC的监管已经开过来了，病床加了很多套防护，上次的错误决不会再犯，你……","style":2,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704108,"trial_step":108},{"step":106,"content":"话还没说完，你看到他已经缓缓闭上眼，带着你从未见过的，松弛的微笑。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704109,"trial_step":109},{"step":107,"content":"于是你也叹了口气，给他掖掖被窝，安静地退出病房。","style":3,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704110,"trial_step":110},{"step":108,"content":"【病房，夜晚】","style":18,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704111,"trial_step":111},{"step":109,"content":"锈没有说谎，那夜确实没想逃，他睡了过去，睡得很沉。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704112,"trial_step":112},{"step":110,"content":"这次梦里唤他的不再是永远无法逃离的黑环，这次，他梦见了些……早被忘记的事。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704113,"trial_step":113},{"step":111,"content":"【回忆】","style":18,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704114,"trial_step":114},{"step":112,"speaker":"地底老人","content":"小鬼，听得懂我、说话吗？哭、哭什么哭，你已经够幸运了，能、被黑环留下来，还有命被我、捡回去。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704115,"trial_step":115},{"step":113,"speaker":"地底老人","content":"过来，把眼泪擦了，我食物分你。你是我捡回来的，不会让你死的。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704116,"trial_step":116},{"step":114,"content":"【回忆转场】","style":18,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704117,"trial_step":117},{"step":115,"speaker":"地底老人","content":"你想要个名字？那我去找祭司——","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704118,"trial_step":118},{"step":116,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>不要，你给我起一个。</color><i>","style":3,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704119,"trial_step":119},{"step":117,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>你把我原来的名字抹了，得再给我一个。</color><i>","style":3,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704120,"trial_step":120},{"step":118,"speaker":"地底老人","content":"……真麻烦，又不是地上的虫子，起什么名……","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704121,"trial_step":121},{"step":119,"speaker":"地底老人","content":"……","style":1,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704122,"trial_step":122},{"step":120,"speaker":"地底老人","content":"……那就叫■■■吧。以前我小孩叫这个，你拿去吧。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":202130,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704123,"trial_step":123},{"step":121,"content":"【回忆交叠】","style":18,"background":924,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704124,"trial_step":124},{"step":122,"speaker":"矿阱保安","content":"你名字不好念啊异邦小朋友，到时候喊着喊着舌头打结了也不得行。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":924,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704125,"trial_step":125},{"step":123,"speaker":"矿阱保安","content":"给你个小名儿咋样？邻居来了也好称呼。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_143"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":924,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704126,"trial_step":126},{"step":124,"speaker":"矿阱保安","content":"以后你还会在这儿过很久，就当是新开始吧。叫■■咋样？或者你给自己起一个？","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":924,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704127,"trial_step":127},{"step":125,"content":"【回忆交叠】","style":18,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704128,"trial_step":128},{"step":126,"speaker":"棘","content":"■■■■？！太好了，抢救回来了！我是■■，还记得吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704129,"trial_step":129},{"step":127,"speaker":"棘","content":"……对了，得用代号……我是“棘”，想起来没？你的代号是“锈”，我们俩都是第九机关的特工，是搭档。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704130,"trial_step":130},{"step":128,"speaker":"棘","content":"“锈”这个名字，你还有印象吗？他们都这么叫你。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2106,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704131,"trial_step":131},{"step":129,"content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":904,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704132,"trial_step":132},{"step":130,"speaker":"店主","content":"有他的消息就行，唉真是……好歹是个熟客，师父惦记了两年，开发那么多新菜都没给他吃上。麻烦二位见他了也递句话，让他回来看看，我好歹能还原几道。","voice":["vo_trial_10702_1_177"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":904,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704133,"trial_step":133},{"step":131,"content":"【转场】","style":18,"background":111,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704134,"trial_step":134},{"step":132,"speaker":"桑吉","content":"如果有他消息，还请您告诉我们。不论是好是坏。","voice":["vo_trial_10702_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":111,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704135,"trial_step":135},{"step":133,"speaker":"桑吉","content":"他永远是锈火的朋友。","voice":["vo_trial_10702_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":111,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704136,"trial_step":136},{"step":134,"content":"【露局长立绘】","style":18,"background":2473,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704137,"trial_step":137},{"step":135,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"我想知道你真正的名字。","style":1,"background":2473,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704138,"trial_step":138},{"step":136,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"不管你去哪里，死多少次，换多少身体执行什么任务……你都是我的朋友。","style":1,"background":2473,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704139,"trial_step":139},{"step":137,"content":"【回归现实】","style":18,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704140,"trial_step":140},{"step":138,"content":"没有噩梦的夜晚，他醒得太早了些。愣愣地看着天花板，许久没回过神。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704141,"trial_step":141},{"step":139,"speaker":"锈","content":"…………","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704142,"trial_step":142},{"step":140,"speaker":"锈","content":"……这么下去不太行……","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_124"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704143,"trial_step":143},{"step":141,"content":"他抬手按住身上的裂痕……还好，还没太松懈，他还听得到黑环的呼唤，听得到混沌另一侧传来的声音。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704144,"trial_step":144},{"step":142,"speaker":"混沌的低语","content":"……■■■……■■■■……","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704145,"trial_step":145},{"step":143,"content":"还真是久违的声音。要是早点来说不定那枷锁还能听到……可惜。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704146,"trial_step":146},{"step":144,"content":"<i><color=#7683a2>……来得真是时候。</color><i>","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704147,"trial_step":147},{"step":145,"speaker":"锈","content":"呵呵……还是先上路吧。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704149,"trial_step":149},{"step":146,"content":"锈起身，找出藏好的小机关。能治他的官方医院就这么几家，他早踩好点做好安排。","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704150,"trial_step":150},{"step":147,"content":"瞧，线人这不就来了吗？","style":3,"background":2107,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704151,"trial_step":151},{"step":148,"content":"【转场】MBCC大门外","style":18,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704152,"trial_step":152},{"step":149,"speaker":"？？","content":"嘿老乡，跑路前是不是把账结了？","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704153,"trial_step":153},{"step":150,"content":"他回头，白衣的刺客不知何时倚在门框边。凭借超速的异能，她又一次轻松躲过所有监控，就像第九机关的软禁一样形同虚设。","style":3,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704154,"trial_step":154},{"step":151,"speaker":"白逸","content":"上周捞你出来可费我不少功夫，价钱涨一点，翻一番，不过分吧？这次还要帮忙吗？","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704155,"trial_step":155},{"step":152,"speaker":"锈","content":"没问题，第九机关报销，随便开价。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704156,"trial_step":156},{"step":153,"speaker":"锈","content":"你只要担心还有没有时间花就行。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704157,"trial_step":157},{"step":154,"speaker":"白逸","content":"……","style":1,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704158,"trial_step":158},{"step":155,"speaker":"白逸","content":"没事，我腿脚快，就算那女人来也追不上我。倒是你……","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_134"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704159,"trial_step":159},{"step":156,"speaker":"白逸","content":"不是说等着他们，绝不逃跑吗？现在是怎么回事？","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704160,"trial_step":160},{"step":157,"content":"锈顿了顿，笑了。","style":3,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704161,"trial_step":161},{"step":158,"speaker":"锈","content":"面对地底人我绝不逃跑。但现在……来了一个比他们还吓人的家伙。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704162,"trial_step":162},{"step":159,"content":"再拖下去，也许各种意义上都很难离开了吧。但……还不行，没到时候。","style":3,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704163,"trial_step":163},{"step":160,"speaker":"锈","content":"也不能算逃跑，我还是给他留了消息的。","female_content":"也不能算逃跑，我还是给她留了消息的。","voice":["vo_trial_10704_1_142","vo_trial_10704_1_142f"],"voice_bank":"vo_rust_trial","style":1,"background":1020109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704164,"trial_step":164},{"step":161,"content":"【MBCC办公室】","style":18,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704165,"trial_step":165},{"step":162,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"…………………………","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704166,"trial_step":166},{"step":163,"content":"抽屉被打开，监控被屏蔽，那男人上次“出逃”就已经完成踩点，这次竟轻轻松松反向潜入，一数库存，少了5异方晶，那家伙竟还肆无忌惮地在你桌上留了言。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704167,"trial_step":167},{"step":164,"content":"<i>亲爱的局长，\n\n临时接了个差事，要出远门。抱歉不能当面向您道别，最后的时间我要用来还清其他私人债，而且再拖下去……也许各种意义上都很难再离开了。\n所以，抱歉，别辛苦用枷锁追我，太耗神。我抄了MBCC的联系方式，等到了地方，会联系您的。\n\n也借您一点小财护身。我保证，以后会连本带息，连同欠下的那个回答一起补上。锈<i>","style":14,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704168,"trial_step":168},{"step":165,"content":"你把纸条揉皱了扔到墙角。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704169,"trial_step":169},{"step":166,"content":"——他猜你会是这样的反应。锈笑笑，有些不舍地转身，告别这短暂的活着的时光，走进面前的内海黑环，融了进去，回到他该行的路上。","style":3,"background":2069109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704170,"trial_step":170},{"step":167,"content":"但……这次的保证不是谎言。","style":3,"background":2069109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704171,"trial_step":171},{"step":168,"content":"<i>无论换多少身体，死多少次，过多少年……欠您的所有，都一定会还。<i>","style":14,"background":2069109,"log_type":1,"src_id":110704172,"trial_step":172}]}